WEBVTT

00:08:29.294 --> 00:08:32.383
we were telling them,
"Would you please support the bill?"

00:08:32.383 --> 00:08:37.142
And we don't have
much technology like here,

00:08:37.142 --> 00:08:39.139
but we have our small phones.

00:08:39.139 --> 00:08:44.169
So we said, "Why can't we get 
their numbers and text them?"

00:08:44.178 --> 00:08:47.428
So we did that. It was a good thing.

00:08:47.428 --> 00:08:49.448
(Applause)

00:08:49.448 --> 00:08:52.421
So when the bill passed,
we texted them back,

00:08:52.421 --> 00:08:54.849
"Thank you for supporting the bill."

00:08:54.849 --> 00:08:55.919
(Laughter)

00:08:55.919 --> 00:08:59.264
And when the bill was signed
by the president,

00:08:59.264 --> 00:09:02.630
making it into law, it was a plus.